# Allowlist: sync notes, evidence images, small text evidence, and Meridian's
# work state. Everything else (traces, logs, JSON dumps, runtimes, binaries)
# stays local.
*
!*/
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.html
!*.csv
!*.tsv
!*.diff
!*.patch
!*.mmd
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.webp
!*.gif
!*.svg
!__status.json
!/.gitignore
